    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mqpw2ak"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "NNP at Factor Cost (NNP_FC) is officially recognized as the National Income of a nation.",
        "Depreciation must be deducted from Gross aggregates to derive Net aggregates (e.g., GDP - Depreciation = NDP).",
        "Central Statistics Office (CSO), now under the National Statistical Office (NSO), is the primary agency responsible for National Income estimation in India.",
        "Transfer payments (like pensions and scholarships) are excluded from National Income calculations as they do not reflect current production."
      ],
      "id": "mf33lt9"
